# Agent vs Plan mode

**Agent mode:** Implement the request. Do not ask whether to implement, and do not wait for plan approval. Do not switch to Plan mode only to ask.

**Plan mode:** Present a short plan and wait for approval before coding.

If the user wants to be asked first, they will switch to Plan mode.
